hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"346","[AI-translation] Hamein Muhammad bin Bashar ne hadith bayan ki, unhonne kaha: Hamein Muhammad bin Jafar ne hadith bayan ki, unhonne kaha: Hamein Shubah ne hadith bayan ki, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Abdullah al-Jadali se (aur unka naam Abd bin Abd hai), Aisha se. Unhone kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) fahash nahi the, na hi fahash baat karne wale, na bazaaron mein shor machane wale, aur na buraai ke badle buraai karne wale, balki maaf farmate aur darguzar farmate."
"347","[AI-translation] Hamein Harun bin Ishaq al-Hamdani ne hadith bayan ki, unhonne kaha: Hamein Abda ne hadith bayan ki, Hisham bin Urwah se, unke walid se, Aisha se. Unhone kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne apne haath se kabhi kisi cheez ko nahi maara, illa ke Allah ki raah mein jihad karte, aur na kisi naukar ko maara aur na kisi aurat ko."
